    "A clock has two hands: the SHORT hand shows hours, the LONG hand shows minutes.",
    "When the long hand points at 12, it's something O'CLOCK: short hand on 3 → 3 o'clock.",
    "When the long hand points at 6, it's HALF PAST: short hand between 4 and 5 → half past 4.",
    "Half past means 30 minutes after the hour: half past 4 = 4:30."
